## Game data — `RoseData/`, `overlay/content/`

Item, NPC, quest, recipe, drop, and zone tables extracted from the ROSE Online
client's own data files, plus icon art from the same source, plus guide and
event text adapted from community and official ROSE Online guides. Copyright
remains with Rednim Games and the respective authors. It is included so a fresh
clone or install has a working catalog offline; it is not licensed for reuse
elsewhere.

If you own this content and want it removed, open an issue and it will be
taken out.

## Community mods — `mods/`

Client-file mods the mod manager can install. They stay the property of their
authors:

- **Visual Damage Effect (PVM)** and **Visual Damage Effect (PVP)** — by
  **@Luckystriike** (ROSE Online forums). PVM embeds the font *Lovely Bubbles*
  by hawtpixel; PVP embeds *Road Rage* by Youssef Habchi. Credits in each mod's
  `README.html`.
- **Larger Drops - Big** — by RoseLite. The meshes are generated from stock game
  assets by scaling vertex positions only; the underlying assets remain Rednim
  Games'.

## Bundled fonts — `overlay/assets/fonts/`

